<urn:atm:triage:finding/CPR-026>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "CPR-026" ;
  triage:title "atm task close materialises every task row on the team on every close" ;
  triage:description "Hostile closure review (general-purpose opus, task af4edaf6699568f49) @ 9f5aef2fe. `atm task close` materialises every task row on the team on every close. Doc says: Design §7 treats the task query surface as an oversight read path, not a per-write dependency. Code does: task.rs:301-308 calls task_list_request(..., None) — all members, all states, unpaged — and hands the whole Vec<TaskRow> to preflight_close, which does a linear find (crates/atm-core/src/task_close.rs:16). There is no get_task(team, id) read path. Recommendation: Add a single-row task read path for close preflight, and either push the query types down to the daemon or stop presenting them as transport contracts. fenix's ruling: add task_id push-down for a single-row close-preflight read path; push TaskListQuery/TaskEventQuery types down to the daemon or stop presenting them as transport contracts." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
  triage:category "efficiency" ;
  triage:severity "minor" ;
  triage:source "qa" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "crates/atm/src/commands/task.rs" ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-12T07:08:18Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "fenix (ATM 01M2ADJ2394TE0DKP851WPBJ0V, 2026-09-12T09:00:46Z): pushed by arch-ctm at review-2 2e952215b (fix(tasks): push close preflight task filter down); accepted on review, fixed-pending-gate (fenix's gate run in flight). A tidy commit (expect() removal + positive reader test) will arrive with CPR-023 and becomes the CPR-026 head. Gate-green confirmed (ATM 01M2ADPN4VA1NRSZ7CWDJB64CJ, 2026-09-12T09:03:17Z): 13-gate-green on fenix's host (cli_surface 2/2); CPR-026 closed at 2e952215b. The CPR-023 tidy commit will be a head remap only. fenix (ATM 01M2ADZCQ0CZSWBYN826TGSV8N, 2026-09-12T09:08:03Z): head remap -- 2e952215b -> cce076f1c (tidy: expect() removed, positive reader test; accepted). Covered by the gate run on CPR-023's 739833663 in flight; status fixed pending that gate confirmation. Gate-green confirmed (ATM 01M2AE1PD5D61SGTXP6H1DVFJA, 2026-09-12T09:09:18Z): 13-gate-green on fenix's host (cli_surface 2/2) via the CPR-023 739833663 run; CPR-026 closed at its tidy head cce076f1c." ;
  triage:foundIn triage:BA6 ;
  triage:foundAt "2026-09-12T07:08:18Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/CPR-026/1> ;
  triage:hasOccurrence <urn:atm:triage:occurrence/CPR-026/2> ;
  triage:triageRecordVersion "2" .

